invariant: INV-48
file: keccak_avx2.c
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh mlkem-avx2
reason: chi ANDs b1 with b2 where FIPS 202 ANDs its complement, VPAND
  where VPANDN belongs. Only an x86-64 compiler reads the line, so the script builds
  bin/mlkem_avx2_equiv_test for x86-64 and runs it under
  qemu-x86_64. The lane skips without docker, and this then reports
  unguarded rather than caught.

--- old
    return lanes_xor(b0, _mm256_andnot_si256(b1, b2));
--- new
    return lanes_xor(b0, _mm256_and_si256(b1, b2));
